WEBVTT

00:00.520 --> 00:04.800
No one could threaten me before and never will in the future.

00:08.920 --> 00:13.547
In this life will only have one wife, the Xie family.

00:15.000 --> 00:20.200
April of the 24th year of Xuan Sikong Yao purged the capital's gentry.

00:20.600 --> 00:26.400
Chen Dao, finally arriving, was enraged ordered Qingzhou Army to wear white headbands and fiercely attacked the capital.

00:26.480 --> 00:32.440
Soon after, Zu Yue was also drawn into battle Xuan thus fell into prolonged civil war.

00:34.500 --> 00:46.000
Prince Ning ascended the throne as Emperor and declared a general amnesty, yet had your lineage entirely struck from the imperial genealogy.

